---

<!-- 3. 12-STAGE DETAILED ROADMAP -->
<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low border-y border-outline-variant/20 py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="font-headline text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary">
          The Blueprint
        </span>
        <div class="h-0.5 w-8 bg-primary/30"></div>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-on-surface">
        Full 12-Stage Execution Roadmap
      </h2>
      
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        The disciplined, clockwork sequence guiding your project from opening exploratory dialogue to keys handover.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Flow -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col gap-6 before:absolute before:left-[19px] before:top-4 before:bottom-4 before:w-[2px] before:bg-outline-variant/40">
      
      <!-- Stage 01 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          01
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 01 — INITIAL CONSULTATION</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Discovery</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">EVERY PROJECT STARTS WITH A CONVERSATION</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            In-depth alignment covering aesthetic ambitions, spatial functional needs, timeline considerations, and realistic capital allocation.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-1 text-xs">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-3 rounded-xl">
              <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface block mb-0.5">Client Role</span>
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-[11px]">Share architectural vision, spatial lifestyle priorities, and budget scope.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-3 rounded-xl">
              <span class="font-semibold text-primary block mb-0.5">Paanya Role</span>
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-[11px]">Assess project feasibility, evaluate constraints, and outline preliminary roadmap.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 02 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          02
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 02 — SITE FEASIBILITY</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Site Intelligence</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">UNDERSTANDING THE SITE BEFORE BUILDING</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Topographic surveying, geotechnical soil core sampling, solar orientation analysis, wind path simulation, and local zoning bylaws.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container text-[10px] font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Soil Geotechnical Bearing</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container text-[10px] font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Solar Path Tracking</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container text-[10px] font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Contour Survey</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 03 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          03
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 03 — ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Concept & BIM</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">TURNING REQUIREMENTS INTO A PLAN</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Iterative conceptualization, massing studies, volumetric 3D BIM models, spatial choreography, and photorealistic design reviews.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary shrink-0"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-on-surface">3D Immersive BIM Walkthrough Reviewed &amp; Approved by Client</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 04 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          04
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 04 — COST ESTIMATION</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Commercial Certainty</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">CLARITY BEFORE CONSTRUCTION</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Granular Bill of Quantities (BOQ), verified trade schedules, locked-in material pricing, and zero ambiguous allowances.
          </p>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-wide uppercase">Fixed Milestone Contract &amp; Transparent Contingencies</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 05 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          05
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 05 — STATUTORY APPROVALS</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Sanctions & Permits</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">REGULATORY &amp; MUNICIPAL CLEARANCE</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Full management of architectural submissions, structural engineering certifications, zoning variances, and municipal building permits.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-on-surface font-medium">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
            All Liaison &amp; Documentation Handled Completely In-House
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 06 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          06
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 06 — PROJECT MOBILIZATION</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Site Staging</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">A PLAN FOR EVERY STAGE OF THE BUILD</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Critical path scheduling, specialized trade vetting, early raw material requisition, safety fencing, and on-site engineering team deployment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 07 (With Image) -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          07
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 07 — STRUCTURAL BUILD</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Superstructure</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">THIS IS WHERE THE PLAN BECOMES REAL</h3>
          
          <div class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl bg-cover bg-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" 
              alt="Live Engineering Surveillance" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 text-xs text-white font-medium tracking-wide">
              Live Structural Engineering &amp; Frame Assembly
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Earthworks &amp; Footings</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Reinforced Columns</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Masonry &amp; Partitions</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Roof Slab Pours</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 08 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          08
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 08 — MEP INTEGRATION</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Infrastructure</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">THE SYSTEMS BEHIND THE SPACE</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Mechanical ventilation, acoustic plumbing conduits, centralized HVAC ducting, automation wiring, and surge-protected distribution units.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium text-secondary">
            Hydrostatic and electrical load pressure tests completed before wall enclosure to permanently eliminate latent leaks.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 09 (With Image) -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          09
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 09 — INTERIOR ARCHITECTURE</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Fit-Out</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">FROM STRUCTURE TO EXPERIENCE</h3>
          
          <div class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl bg-cover bg-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" 
              alt="Custom Spatial Realization" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 text-xs text-white font-medium tracking-wide">
              Custom Spatial Realization &amp; Millwork
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Monolithic natural stone focal features, engineered architectural millwork, bespoke kitchen systems, acoustic paneling, and architectural lighting schemes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 10 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          10
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 10 — BESPOKE FINISHING</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Detailing</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">PRECISION LIVES IN THE DETAILS</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Minimal reveal shadow lines, acoustic door seals, Italian large-format porcelain, micro-cement surfacing, and flawless multi-coat paint.
          </p>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-wide uppercase">Zero Tolerances on Glazing Alignment &amp; Vein Matching</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 11 (Navy Accent Block) -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          11
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-[#071A33] text-on-primary p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-md flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-fixed font-headline">STAGE 11 — RIGOROUS QUALITY AUDIT</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary-fixed uppercase tracking-wider">Quality Gate</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white uppercase">BEFORE WE HAND IT OVER, WE AUDIT</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-surface-container-high leading-relaxed font-light">
            Laser level alignment checks, moisture scans, acoustic insulation tests, pressure decay tests, and complete snagging remediation before client walk-through.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1.5 text-center text-[10px] font-bold pt-1 text-primary-fixed">
            <div class="bg-white/10 py-2 rounded-lg">INSPECT</div>
            <div class="bg-white/10 py-2 rounded-lg">REVIEW</div>
            <div class="bg-white/10 py-2 rounded-lg">CORRECT</div>
            <div class="bg-white/10 py-2 rounded-lg">VERIFY</div>
            <div class="bg-primary text-white py-2 rounded-lg">PASS</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 12 (With Handover Image) -->
      <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline font-bold text-xs shadow-md shrink-0 z-10 mt-1">
          12
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-headline">STAGE 12 — COMMENCEMENT &amp; KEY HANDOVER</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Celebration</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-on-surface uppercase">FROM OUR HANDS TO YOUR HOME</h3>
          
          <div class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 rounded-xl bg-cover bg-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" 
              alt="Turnkey Occupancy Granted" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 text-xs text-white font-medium tracking-wide">
              Turnkey Occupancy Granted · Warranty Activated
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Joint walk-through review, transfer of municipal occupancy certifications, equipment operation dossiers, and active long-term 10-year structural warranty registration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
